   "text": "People tellin' lies on me"
  },
  {
   "start": 41.4,
   "end": 43.5,
   "text": "Feelin' like Pac, All Eyez on Me"
  },
  {
   "start": 43.8,
   "end": 45.8,
   "text": "What my next rhyme gon' be?"
  },
  {
   "start": 45.9,
   "end": 48.2,
   "text": "Dumb motherfuckers never ever gon' shine off me"
  },
  {
   "start": 48.4,
   "end": 51.0,
   "text": "Wait for it, wait for it, wait for it"
  },
  {
   "start": 51.0,
   "end": 53.3,
   "text": "Don't worry, my haters is gon' pay for it"
  },
  {
   "start": 53.4,
   "end": 55.7,
   "text": "Chase dreams while dumb niggas'll chase whores"
  },
  {
   "start": 55.8,
   "end": 58.0,
   "text": "Overseas on a great tour, or"
  },
  {
   "start": 58.2,
   "end": 59.8,
   "text": "Maybe I'm just dreamin'"
  },
  {
   "start": 60.0,
   "end": 63.1,
   "text": "It beats bein' with demons or niggas that's schemin'"
  },
  {
   "start": 63.1,
   "end": 65.1,
   "text": "At least I'm thinkin' of an achievement"
  },
  {
   "start": 65.1,
   "end": 67.5,
   "text": "People talk shit for four seasons for no reason"
  },
  {
